Note

beta-Beryllene_full_hollow_2 is equal to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow_1

beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_3 is equal to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_2

beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_2 is similar to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_1

    full hh3 = full hh2 ≈ full hh1

beta-Beryllene_full_top is similar to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow_1

    full top ≈ full h1

beta-Beryllene_third_top-hollow_2 is equal to beta-Beryllene_third_hollow-hollow_4

    third th2 = third hh4

beta-Beryllene_third_top-top is equal to beta-Beryllene_third_hollow-hollow_1

    third tt = third hh1